{"title":"住房城乡建设部关于修改《房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程施工招标投标管理办法》的决定","date":"2018-10-11","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0cm; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:#222222\">住房城乡建设部关于修改《房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程施工招标投标管理办法》的决定</span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0cm; text-align: center; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<section style=\"padding: 2em 5px 5px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin-bottom: -3.6em;margin-left: -6px;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"border-top-left-radius: 5px;display: inline-block;background: #20d2fc;height: 30px;padding-right: 0.5em;padding-left: 1em;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 30px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0px;height: 0px;border-top: 30px solid transparent;border-left: 20px solid #20d2fc;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0px;height: 0px;border-top: 30px solid #20d2fc;border-right: 20px solid transparent;margin-left: -20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0px;height: 0px;border-bottom: 6px solid transparent;border-right: 6px solid #e9ae20;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border-radius: 20px; padding: 0.4em; box-shadow: rgb(211, 211, 211) 0px 0px 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: #20d2fc;padding: 3.4em 1em 1em;border-radius: 15px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 20px;\">为贯彻落实国务院深化&ldquo;放管服&rdquo;改革，优化营商环境的要求，住房城乡建设部决定对《房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程施工招标投标管理办法》（建设部令第89号）作如下修改：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">一、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">将第二条第一款修改为：&ldquo;依法必须进行招标的房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程（以下简称工程），其施工招标投标活动，适用本办法&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">二、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第三条。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">三、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第十一条第二款中的&ldquo;具有相应资格的&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">四、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第十八条第一款第一项中的&ldquo;（包括银行出具的资金证明）&rdquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; color: #222222; font-size: 17px;\">。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">五、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第四十七条第一款中的&ldquo;订立书面合同后7日内，中标人应当将合同送工程所在地的县级以上地方人民政府建设行政主管部门备案&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">六、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第五十三条中的&ldquo;招标人拒不改正的，不得颁发施工许可证&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">七、</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">删去第五十四条中的&ldquo;在未提交施工招标投标情况书面报告前，建设行政主管部门不予颁发施工许可证&rdquo;。</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #222222; font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">此外，对相关条文顺序作相应调整。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #222222; font-size: 20px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">本决定自发布之日起施行。《房屋建筑和市政基础设施工程施工招标投标管理办法》根据本决定作相应修改，重新发布。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 16px 0;text-indent: 32px;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\">\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>"}